s=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-revised"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"input_verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,E_T,g,D,\\gamma,\\mathrm{Prf}_T,e_{\\mathrm{prf}}\">\\(T,E_T,g,D,\\gamma,\\mathrm{Prf}_T,e_{\\mathrm{prf}}\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0cb59478595f5c6\" href=\"?note=a0cb59478595f5c6\" title=\"67-df-rosser-sentence\">67-df-rosser-sentence</a> 的全部前提；不假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ng}(g(\\varphi))=g(\\neg\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{ng}(g(\\varphi))=g(\\neg\\varphi)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\)</span>），非法码取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；固定其 PR 程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{\\mathrm{ng}}\">\\(e_{\\mathrm{ng}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{e_{\\mathrm{ng}}}\">\\(\\delta_{e_{\\mathrm{ng}}}\\)</span> 取同一个图公式族。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v,p,q,w\">\\(v,p,q,w\\)</span> 各异；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_T(v)\">\\(\\rho_T(v)\\)</span> 在下式构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ros}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Ros}_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 和无捕获代入均使用本册接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists q&lt;S p\">\\(\\exists q&lt;S p\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a> 的有界量词构造；图代入量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists w(\\delta_{e_{\\mathrm{ng}}}(v,w)\\land\\cdot)\">\\(\\exists w(\\delta_{e_{\\mathrm{ng}}}(v,w)\\land\\cdot)\\)</span> 使用同一条目的图代入闭包。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho_T(v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall p\\left(\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,v)\\to\n\\exists q&lt;S p\\,\\exists w\\left(\\delta_{e_{\\mathrm{ng}}}(v,w)\\land\\mathrm{Prf}_T(q,w)\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\rho_T&amp;\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v],\\\\\n\\exists R\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ \\bigl[&amp;\nQ\\vdash(R\\leftrightarrow\\rho_T(\\overline{g(R)}))\\land\\mathrm{Ros}_T(R)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho_T(v)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall p\\left(\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,v)\\to\n\\exists q&lt;S p\\,\\exists w\\left(\\delta_{e_{\\mathrm{ng}}}(v,w)\\land\\mathrm{Prf}_T(q,w)\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\rho_T&amp;\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v],\\\\\n\\exists R\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ \\bigl[&amp;\nQ\\vdash(R\\leftrightarrow\\rho_T(\\overline{g(R)}))\\land\\mathrm{Ros}_T(R)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由 PR 图公式定义扩张及有界量词闭包，核公式属于 Π1；使用同层固定点定理。否定码函数的 Q 上逐数唯一表示将固定点双条件改写为 Ros_T 的双条件。该存在性不使用一致性，一致性仅在不可证性结论中使用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"a0cb59478595f5c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-rosser-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f76c99f69499336d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-pr-graph-interface","status":"resolved","id":"f115352299e944bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-pr-graph-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"a0cb59478595f5c6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,E_T,g,D,\\gamma,\\mathrm{Prf}_T,e_{\\mathrm{prf}}$ 满足 [[67-df-rosser-sentence]] 的全部前提；不假定 $T$ 一致。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\exists q<S p$ 使用 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]] 的有界量词构造；图代入量词 $\\exists w(\\delta_{e_{\\mathrm{ng}}}(v,w)\\land\\cdot)$ 使用同一条目的图代入闭包。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,E_T,g,D,\\gamma,\\mathrm{Prf}_T,e_{\\mathrm{prf}}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ng}(g(\\varphi))=g(\\neg\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"e_{\\mathrm{ng}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_{e_{\\mathrm{ng}}}","display":false},{"tex":"v,p,q,w","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_T(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ros}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists q<S p","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists w(\\delta_{e_{\\mathrm{ng}}}(v,w)\\land\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho_T(v)&\\coloneqq\\forall p\\left(\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,v)\\to\n\\exists q<S p\\,\\exists w\\left(\\delta_{e_{\\mathrm{ng}}}(v,w)\\land\\mathrm{Prf}_T(q,w)\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\rho_T&\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v],\\\\\n\\exists R\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ \\bigl[&\nQ\\vdash(R\\leftrightarrow\\rho_T(\\overline{g(R)}))\\land\\mathrm{Ros}_T(R)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2183,"backlinks":[{"id":"e972b0d757b4f3a3","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 取 [[67-df-consistent]]，$\\mathrm{Ros}_T$ 取 [[67-df-rosser-sentence]]。Rosser 固定点的存在性取 [[67-lem-rosser-fixed-point-existence]]，不依赖未提供的第90册文件。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-lem-rosser-fixed-point-existence]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-lem-rosser-fixed-point-existence]]"}],"outgoing":["a0cb59478595f5c6","f76c99f69499336d","f115352299e944bf","851cd80e64893935"]}